# Line endings: LF in every checkout on every OS, so Windows core.autocrlf no longer rewrites files
# (copied scripts such as .github/registry-check.py stay byte-identical to workstation).
# Same base rules as workstation and handbuilt-cad. Git still auto-detects other binaries.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psd1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.step binary
*.stp binary
*.stl binary
*.3mf binary
*.f3d binary
*.svg binary
